# Upstream tags weeklies as `weekly-YYYY.MM.DD` and also carries release tags
# (`1.1.1`) and release candidates. Accept only the dated weeklies, and hand
# nix-update the bare date, which is what `version` holds and what `rev`
# reassembles into the tag.
--version-regex ^weekly-([0-9]{4}\.[0-9]{2}\.[0-9]{2})$
